{
  "allowed_mentions": {
    "parse": [],
  },
  "components": [
    {
      "components": [
        {
          "content": "# Meetup @everyone

Starts: <t:1798772400:F> (<t:1798772400:R>)

Ends: <t:1798783200:F> (<t:1798783200:R>)

Venue
Tokyo

Confirmed: 4/20

🟢 Registration open

### Important rules
- Registering means accepting the server and event rules. You must be at least 20 on the event day.
- Fees are non-refundable after confirmation. Ask the organizer about questions or exceptional circumstances.

### How to join
- Select Join and submit the required answers.
- Use My status to check confirmation or waitlist status and edit answers. Submitting does not always confirm a place.

### Cancellation
- Select Cancel registration, then confirm on the next screen. Contact the organizer if you cannot complete the cancellation.

### Conduct and practical notes
- Respect people around you and follow staff instructions and venue policies, including smoking rules.
- Check dietary and allergy accommodations with the organizer before registering.
- Respect others' consent and privacy when taking photos. Get staff approval before filming or streaming.
- Keep bags compact, look after your belongings, and clear up your rubbish. Ask staff about lost property.
- Be considerate across language differences. Follow organizer guidance for private trades; arrangements remain the responsibility of those involved.",
          "type": 10,
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "custom_id": "om1:join:12345678-1234-4234-8234-123456789012",
              "label": "Join",
              "style": 1,
              "type": 2,
            },
            {
              "custom_id": "om1:status:12345678-1234-4234-8234-123456789012",
              "label": "My status",
              "style": 2,
              "type": 2,
            },
            {
              "custom_id": "om1:cancel:12345678-1234-4234-8234-123456789012",
              "label": "Cancel registration",
              "style": 4,
              "type": 2,
            },
          ],
